Description:
Medrego Biotech Innovations & Advisory is your partner in the Life Science world!

Our expertise covers CAR T-cell therapies, Gene Therapies, Stem Cell Therapies, and ATMP product development and regulatory frameworks.  

Medrego team expert experience:
- acting as a member of the European Medicines Agency (EMA) Committee for Advanced Therapy Products and Cell Product Working Party;
- professional involvement in the classification and marketing authorization evaluation procedures;
- participation in the drafting process of related guidelines;
- Core membership of the Cell Product Working Party (CPWP) at the European Medicines Agency (EMA);
- External expertise at The State Agency of Medicines.
- Taking part in successful EU project R&D activities.
- Private Business consultations for the European Commission, Government bodies, KPMG, Voisin Consulting and others.
